<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Helen - (built 1978) 42,566 dwt plus sistership:</p>
<p>Delores - (built 1978) 42,566 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $7.2 million &quot;en bloc&quot;</p>
<p>TANKERS - Andromeda - (built 1984) 63,950 dwt sold to Greek buyers $18.4 million.</p>
<p>TWEENDECKERS - Ibn Khaldoun - (built 1979) 8,127 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $2.25 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
